        "More profound growth retardation and early mortality"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "18q-deletion-syndrome",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Deletion rather than duplication of distal 18q",
        "Hypotonia and developmental delay but different facial features",
        "Different genetic test results"
      ]
    }
  ],
